  "description": "Hi team,\n\nPlease find below the current Cosmos configuration for our project. The setup follows the schema located at\u202fhttp://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#. All source files live under the **src** directory, and static assets are served from the **public** folder with a base URL of **/static/**. Fixtures are stored in the default **__fixtures__** directories and use the **fixture** suffix. The system watches both the **src** and **tests** directories for changes, and a user\u2011dependency map is written to\u202f**cosmos.userdeps.js**. The development server accepts any hostname (hostname is null) on port\u202f6000, runs over HTTPS using the certificate at\u202f**certs/dev\u2011cert.pem** and the key at\u202f**certs/dev\u2011key.pem**. For proxying, requests to\u202f**/api** are forwarded to\u202f**http://localhost:3000**, while calls to\u202f**/auth** are sent to\u202f**https://auth.example.com** (insecure mode, with the \u201c/auth\u201d prefix stripped and debug\u2011level logging enabled). Before any component loads we import **./src/setupTests.js** and **./src/global.css**. The DOM container selector is set to **#app**.\n\nWebpack reuses the existing **webpack.config.js** file, has no override module (overridePath is null), and hot\u2011module reloading is disabled. The UI plugin\u2019s responsive preview includes two device presets: an iPhone\u202fX (375\u202f\u00d7\u202f812) and a Desktop\u202f1440p view (1440\u202f\u00d7\u202f900). Let me know if any adjustments are needed."
